      "text": "WebSocketServiceImpl.enhancedDialog(message, header)\n\nvar sessionId = headerAccessor.getSessionId();\nvar wsSession = sessionManager.getSession(sessionId);\nwsSession.receiveMessage(message);\nagentTaskExecutor.execute(() -> agentRunService.run(wsSession));",
